        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Celabrasion, Thank You, Happy Birthday\n- People: Jay Joyce\n- Organizations: Sleeper Agent, Mom + Pop Music\n\nFacts:\n- Celabrasion is the debut album by the American rock band Sleeper Agent.\n- John Joseph \"Jay\" Joyce is an American record producer, songwriter, and session musician.\n- Celabrasion was produced by Jay Joyce.\n- Celabrasion was released digitally on iTunes on August 2, 2011, via Mom + Pop Music.\n- Celabrasion was released physically on September 27, 2011.\n- Jay Joyce produced the album Thank You, Happy Birthday.\n- Jay Joyce also worked as producer on that band's eponymous debut album.",
